  "rationale": "The plant G models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, including all controllable and uncontrollable events, with helper states for action commits and recovery. The specification E enforces safe obstacle-aware exploration: forward motion is prioritized when clear, directed turns are used for local obstacle recovery, move_backward is only allowed after a front obstacle, and full_rotate is reserved for last-resort recovery after repeated blockages. All transitions are deterministic and respect the runtime semantics and safety constraints.",
